[Core] Integrations monitoring data structure  (#1624)

# Description

What - 
1. updated the current event we send with the metrics today.
2. updated the places we send metrics in

example json:
```
{
   {
   "integration_type":"gitlab",
   "integration_identifier":"gitlab-local",
   "integration_version":"0.2.62",
   "ocean_version":"0.22.5",
   "kind_identifier":"group-with-members-0",
   "kind":"group-with-members",
   "event_id":"bf1926ab-ba16-468c-850a-0380530a06a8",
