[Integration] Apply Ocean version 0.32.9 to all integrations (#2611)

### **User description**
This PR was automatically created by a GitHub Action.

## What does this PR do?
Apply Ocean version 0.32.9 to all integrations

## How should this be manually tested?
./scripts/bump-all.sh ^0.32.9


___

### **PR Type**
Enhancement


___

### **Description**
- Upgrade Ocean dependency from ^0.32.8 to ^0.32.9 across all
integrations

- Bump integration patch/minor versions to reflect Ocean dependency
update

- Update CHANGELOG files with new release entries documenting Ocean
version bump


